iew</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->90</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">200 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Patal Poha Chivda to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></div></article><article class=\"glass-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem] h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-secondary/50\"><img alt=\"Instant Kanda Poha Premix\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/kanda-poha.webp\"/><span class=\"glass-pill absolute left-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent shadow-md\">Ready in 5 min</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 p-6\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Instant Kanda Poha Premix</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Maharashtra&#x27;s favourite breakfast, in minutes</p></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need for authentic Kanda Poha in one pack. Just add hot water, rest, and enjoy a soft, fragrant breakfast with onions, chilies and turmeric.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4 pt-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"glass-pill flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-bold text-foreground transition-all hover:bg-white/80 active:scale-[0.98] dark:hover:bg-white/10\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chef-hat h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5.35c0-.457.316-.844.727-1.041a4 4 0 0 0-2.134-7.589 5 5 0 0 0-9.186 0 4 4 0 0 0-2.134 7.588c.411.198.727.585.727 1.041V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 17h12\"></path></svg><span>How to prepare</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary\"><span>View</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->70</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">150 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Instant Kanda Poha Premix to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></div></article><article class=\"glass-card group flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem] h-full\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden bg-secondary/50\"><img alt=\"Instant Upma Premix\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"720\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"block aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/upma.webp\"/><span class=\"glass-pill absolute left-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-accent shadow-md\">Ready in 5 min</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-1 flex-col justify-between gap-4 p-6\"><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Instant Upma Premix</h3><p class=\"text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary\">Comforting South Indian classic</p></div><p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A savoury semolina premix with curry leaves, mustard and chilies. Add hot water for a warm, comforting upma anytime of the day.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-4 pt-2\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"glass-pill flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-2 rounded-2xl px-4 py-2.5 text-left text-xs font-bold text-foreground transition-all hover:bg-white/80 active:scale-[0.98] dark:hover:bg-white/10\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chef-hat h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-5.35c0-.457.316-.844.727-1.041a4 4 0 0 0-2.134-7.589 5 5 0 0 0-9.186 0 4 4 0 0 0-2.134 7.588c.411.198.727.585.727 1.041V20a1 1 0 0 0 1 1Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 17h12\"></path></svg><span>How to prepare</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-extrabold text-primary\"><span>View</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3 w-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></button><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-4 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black tracking-tight text-foreground\">₹<!-- -->70</span><span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\">150 g<!-- --> pack</span></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Add Instant Upma Premix to order\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-primary-foreground transition-transform hover:scale-[1.03] active:scale-95\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-plus h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"M12 5v14\"></path></svg>Add to order</button></div></div></div></article></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"glass-panel mx-auto max-w-6xl rounded-[2.5rem] p-6 shadow-2xl sm:p-10 md:p-12\"><div class=\"grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative order-last md:order-first group\"><div class=\"absolute -inset-1 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500/20 to-orange-500/20 blur-lg transition-all group-hover:blur-xl\"></div><img alt=\"Freshly prepared Kanda Poha garnished with coriander and coconut\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1200\" height=\"900\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] h-auto w-full rounded-3xl border border-white/70 object-cover shadow-xl backdrop-blur-xl dark:border-white/10\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/kanda-poha.webp\"/></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-5\"><span class=\"glass-pill w-fit rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Our Story</span><h2 class=\"text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Home-style taste, made with care</h2><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Swadam Foods is a women-owned and women-operated business, born from a simple idea — bring the honest, home-style flavours of Indian snacks to busy kitchens everywhere.</p><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">No shortcuts, no artificial flavours — just the authentic taste you grew up loving, ready whenever you are.</p><p class=\"text-pretty leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Based in Pune, Maharashtra, we prepare every batch in small quantities to guarantee freshness. Our instant premixes are designed for busy households — simply add hot water, wait five minutes, and enjoy a home-style breakfast.</p><dl class=\"mt-2 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-white/40 pt-6 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Products</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">3</dd></div><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Preservatives</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">Zero</dd></div><div class=\"glass-pill rounded-2xl p-3 text-center\"><dt class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-muted-foreground\">Made in</dt><dd class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-black text-foreground\">Pune</dd></div></dl></div></div></div></section><section id=\"trust\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center space-y-3\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Official Certifications</span><h2 class=\"text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Certified purity &amp; official compliance</h2><p class=\"text-pretty text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Shop with total confidence. We strictly adhere to Government of India food safety standards and micro-enterprise regulations.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[2.2rem] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border/40 pb-4\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/60 p-2 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md dark:bg-white/10\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 80\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-12 w-auto\" aria-label=\"Women Owned Business Official Logo\"><g transform=\"translate(10, 8)\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#E11D48\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#E11D48\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"20\" stroke=\"#E11D48\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-dasharray=\"2.5 2\"></circle><path d=\"M32 20c-5-5-12-1-12 5 0 8 12 15 12 15s12-7 12-15c0-6-7-10-12-5z\" fill=\"#E11D48\"></path><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"27\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\"></circle></g><text x=\"82\" y=\"30\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"900\" font-size=\"17\" letter-spacing=\"0.5\" fill=\"#E11D48\">WOMEN-OWNED</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"11\" letter-spacing=\"0.4\" fill=\"#1C355E\" class=\"dark:fill-white\">ENTERPRISE</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"58\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"8\" letter-spacing=\"0.6\" fill=\"#15803D\" class=\"dark:fill-emerald-400\">AUTHENTIC HOME-MADE HERITAGE</text></svg></div><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent shrink-0\">Authentic Heritage</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">Women-Owned Enterprise</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Solely owned and run by a woman entrepreneur in Pune — every recipe, spice blend, and batch is handcrafted with traditional family care.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/10 p-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Verified Women Entrepreneurship</span></div></div><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[2.2rem] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border/40 pb-4\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/60 p-2 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md dark:bg-white/10\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 80\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-12 w-auto\" aria-label=\"FSSAI Official Logo\"><path d=\"M48 24C48 14 58 6 72 6C86 6 94 14 94 24C84 20 74 22 66 24C58 26 52 26 48 24Z\" fill=\"#F37021\"></path><path d=\"M56 20C66 12 76 8 90 10C82 17 72 21 62 23C58 23 56 22 56 20Z\" fill=\"#3BB54A\"></path><path d=\"M44 28C48 19 55 14 66 12C57 19 51 24 46 28H44Z\" fill=\"#00AEEF\"></path><text x=\"36\" y=\"56\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"900\" font-size=\"36\" letter-spacing=\"-1.5\" fill=\"#1C355E\" class=\"dark:fill-white\">fssai</text><rect x=\"0\" y=\"64\" width=\"280\" height=\"12\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#1C355E\" class=\"dark:fill-slate-800\"></rect><text x=\"140\" y=\"72.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"6.2\" letter-spacing=\"0.8\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\">FOOD SAFETY AND STANDARDS AUTHORITY OF INDIA</text></svg></div><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent shrink-0\">Food Safety Verified</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">FSSAI Registered &amp; Certified</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Registered with the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India for hygienic, compliant, and quality food manufacturing operations.</p><div class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/50 px-4 py-2.5 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground block\">FSSAI License No.</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-foreground tracking-wide select-all\">21526080002094</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/10 p-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Govt. Food Safety Certified</span></div></div><div class=\"glass-card flex flex-col justify-between rounded-[2.2rem] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-2xl\"><div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 border-b border-border/40 pb-4\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-white/60 p-2 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md dark:bg-white/10\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 280 80\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-12 w-auto\" aria-label=\"Ministry of MSME Official Logo\"><g transform=\"translate(10, 8)\"><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"28\" fill=\"#F47920\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#F47920\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"20\" stroke=\"#003366\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 2\" class=\"dark:stroke-sky-400\"></circle><circle cx=\"32\" cy=\"32\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#003366\" class=\"dark:fill-sky-400\"></circle><path d=\"M32 16v32M16 32h32M21 21l22 22M21 43l22-22\" stroke=\"#003366\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" class=\"dark:stroke-sky-400\"></path><path d=\"M32 14c-4 5-4 10 0 14 4-4 4-9 0-14z\" fill=\"#F47920\"></path><path d=\"M32 36c-4 5-4 10 0 14 4-4 4-9 0-14z\" fill=\"#138808\"></path></g><text x=\"82\" y=\"32\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"900\" font-size=\"22\" letter-spacing=\"1\" fill=\"#003366\" class=\"dark:fill-white\">MSME</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"46\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"800\" font-size=\"10.5\" letter-spacing=\"0.4\" fill=\"#F47920\">सूक्ष्म, लघु एवं मध्यम उद्यम</text><text x=\"82\" y=\"58\" font-family=\"system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" font-size=\"8\" letter-spacing=\"0.6\" fill=\"#475569\" class=\"dark:fill-slate-300\">UDYAM · GOVERNMENT OF INDIA</text></svg></div><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-3 py-1 text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent shrink-0\">Govt. of India</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-xl font-extrabold text-foreground\">UDYAM MSME Registered</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs sm:text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A recognised Micro enterprise under the Ministry of Micro, Small and Medium Enterprises, Government of India.</p><div class=\"mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/60 bg-white/50 px-4 py-2.5 shadow-xs backdrop-blur-md dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\"><span class=\"text-[10px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground block\">UDYAM Reg. No.</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-foreground tracking-wide select-all\">UDYAM-MH-26-1188295</span></div></div><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-500/20 bg-emerald-500/10 p-3.5 text-xs font-bold text-emerald-800 dark:text-emerald-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check lucide-check-circle-2 h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m16 9-5.5 5.5L8 12\"></path></svg><span>Official UDYAM Registration</span></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 py-16 md:py-24\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"mb-12 text-center\"><span class=\"glass-pill rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary shadow-xs\">Questions &amp; Answers</span><h2 class=\"mt-4 text-balance font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl\">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-pretty text-muted-foreground\">Everything you need to know about our Indian snacks, instant premixes, and ordering.</p></div><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-[2.2rem] border border-white/70 bg-white/40 shadow-xl backdrop-blur-2xl divide-y divide-border/60 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-white/5\"><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>What products does Swadam Foods sell?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">We sell three handcrafted products: Patal Poha Chivda (200 g, ₹90), a ready-to-eat crunchy flattened rice snack; Instant Kanda Poha Premix (150 g, ₹70), ready in 5 minutes with hot water; and Instant Upma Premix (150 g, ₹70), also ready in 5 minutes with hot water.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>How do I prepare the Instant Kanda Poha Premix?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to exactly half the amount of premix (1 part water to 2 parts premix), cover the bowl and let it rest. It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>How do I prepare the Instant Upma Premix?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Empty the premix into a bowl, add hot boiling water equal to the same amount as the premix (1 part water to 1 part premix), cover the bowl and let it rest. It will be ready in 5 minutes. Fluff gently and serve.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>How do I order from Swadam Foods?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Add your favourite products to the cart on our website, then proceed to checkout to enter your delivery address and pay securely online via PhonePe/UPI. You will receive live order tracking and live updates on WhatsApp.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Is Swadam Foods a registered business?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Yes. We are FSSAI registered (license no. 21526080002094) and UDYAM MSME registered (UDYAM-MH-26-1188295). We are a women-owned and women-operated business based in Pune, Maharashtra.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 transition-colors hover:bg-white/30 dark:hover:bg-white/[0.03]\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 font-heading text-base font-bold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-question-mark lucide-help-circle lucide-circle-help h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span>Does Patal Poha Chivda need cooking?</span></h3><p class=\"mt-2 pl-6.5 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">No, Patal Poha Chivda is ready to eat — just open the pack and enjoy. It pairs perfectly with a cup of chai or coffee. Reseal the pack tightly after opening to keep it crisp, and store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-10 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Still have questions?<!-- --> <a href=\"https://wa.me/918888851522\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-bold text-primary transition-colors hover:text-accent underline underline-offset-4\">Message us on WhatsApp (+91 88888 51522)</a> <!-- -->and we&#x27;ll be happy to help.</p></div></section></main><footer id=\"contact\" class=\"relative scroll-mt-20 border-t border-white/40 pt-8 dark:border-white/10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"glass-panel relative overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] p-8 text-center sm:p-14 shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute -right-20 -top-20 h-72 w-72 roun